id: pm-rl-t9b1
title: "Run the publish-attestation gate in release:check"
description: "The verify:release-publish-attestation gate was already ported, wired into CI, and covered with tests in both directions (recognise an attested publish, reject an unattested one, and fail when no publish is found so the pass is never vacuous). The only gap was release:check, which did not run the gate. Added npm run verify:release-publish-attestation to release:check in the same position CI uses, after docstring and before coverage."
